   110	immersive `eta_i` should also have `K = 0`; and two `s = 1` carriers on one
   111	component should have *equal* `K`, not merely equal vanishing (`k_t` depends on
   112	`mu_l`, so this is immediate only at equal `mu`). Neither is used below.
