   268	### 4.2 An unbounded side lemma
   269	
   270	**Lemma 4.1 (`OBSTRUCTION[Z-ONLY-COORDINATE]`).** If `f in C[Z] subset RR`
   271	(that is, `Q=0` and `deg_A P = 0`) then `{f,g}=kappa != 0` has no solution
