    34	two coefficient embeddings, and the `+/-` Puiseux expansions are conjugate
    35	series of one branch.
    36	
    37	Neither old `(9,6)` EMPTY kill survives.  A corrected `(9,6,4)` locus is
    38	explicitly NONEMPTY but its six-node question remains OPEN.  The exact curve
    39	
    40	```text
    41	q=t^6+8t^2,  p=t^9+12t^5+24t,
    42	p^2-q^3-64q=64t^2
    43	```
    44	
    45	has exactly four affine nodes and realizes `(9,6,2)`.  The four `(8,6)`
    46	targets require the corrected approximate-root jobs below.  Final suite:
