+### New mechanism: `SOURCE-OPEN-BOUNDARY-LATTICE`
+
+Construct the finite normalization `q:Y->A2` from a full monodromy survivor,
+then seek the *divisor* `B_Y` for which `U=Y-B_Y` is the Keller source `A2` and
+`q|_U` is étale. Do not test whether the whole `Y` is `A2`. Compactify this
+declared `U`, resolve the map and compute the intersection lattice over the line
+at infinity. The new confirmed lemma `det L_tilde_infty<=0` gives a necessary
+sign `[DL:141-176]`; a forced positive determinant kills the source-open
+realization. Missing cover-to-boundary landing data returns typed `OPEN`, not a
+tree inferred from a braid label. This newly connects the repaired literature
+chain to the largest REP-96 geometric gap.
