+## 5. Strongest proof attack
+
+Run `MPRIME-EXACT-DEFICITS`. Under its licensed irreducible nodal `H2+H3`
+scope,
+
+```text
+sum_p(a-a_p)=(a-1)+s(N-a),       0<=a_p<=a.
+```
+
+Therefore `s(2a-N)>=a-1`; writing `a=N-W` gives
+`s(N-2W)>=N-W-1`. This replays the `N=4` contradiction
+`[REP:673-686]`. The new work is to replace the interval bound on each `a_p`
+by the exact leftover-sheet count for every allowed physical local cluster,
+then classify the resulting integer systems at `N=5..8` and recognize the
+uniform inequalities. Count each physical place once; never sum carrier `K_i`
+as a singularity weight `[RN2:270-289]`.
