+parametric survivor proves the information ceiling of `(M')` and redirects the
+flagship to the boundary lattice. The reducible block-free identity is a
+separate branch—its `N=4` control must reproduce `chi_2+sigma_2=1`, not import
+the `H2` formula. In parallel, give one seat to the general-`e` `3x3`
+leading-coefficient determinant already isolated for `A2-CELL-32`
+`[A2:624-649]`; stop that lane if an infinite determinant-zero wall remains.
